I thought tourists might be fun so I started out a new game as one.
I've heard they have a fun quest artifact.

I've been using my camera at every junture.  I'm magic mapping every
level and using my cat to help with all kinds of stuff.  Oddly enough I
found a bronze plate mail so I've got ok armor.

