of blindness and a mimic in a shop.  I used my potion of extra healing
for the blindness.  Eventually the mimic started mimicing a bolder and
I hit him with a bunch of darts.

I'm using most of the stuff I've started with and that is fun.  My cat
cleared out the shop and now I've got to find some place to stash all
